---
import type { PageSeo } from '../../data/site';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';

const seo: PageSeo = {
  title: 'Privacy Policy — Rushes Media',
  description:
    'Privacy Policy for Rushes Group LLC (DBA Rushes Media), including SMS and text messaging consent.',
  canonical: `${SITE.origin}/privacy/`,
};
---

<LegalLayout seo={seo}>

<main>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="eff">Effective June 26, 2026 · Rushes Group LLC (DBA Rushes Media) · Haddon Heights, NJ</p>

  <div class="urls">
    <strong>Privacy Policy URL:</strong> <a href="https://rushesmedia.com/privacy/">https://rushesmedia.com/privacy/</a><br>
    <strong>Terms of Service URL:</strong> <a href="https://rushesmedia.com/terms/">https://rushesmedia.com/terms/</a><br>
    <strong>SMS opt-in (booking form):</strong> <a href="https://rushesmedia.com/#book">https://rushesmedia.com/#book</a>
  </div>

  <p>This Privacy Policy describes how <strong>Rushes Group LLC</strong>, doing business as <strong>Rushes Media</strong> (“we,” “us,” “our”), collects, uses, discloses, and protects personal information when you visit <a href="https://rushesmedia.com/">rushesmedia.com</a>, book a Growth Call, or communicate with us by email, phone, or text.</p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p><strong>Rushes Group LLC</strong> (DBA Rushes Media)<br>
  1636 Oak Avenue, Haddon Heights, NJ 08035<br>
  Email: <a href="mailto:evan@rushesmedia.com">evan@rushesmedia.com</a><br>
  Phone: <a href="tel:+16094059918">(609) 405-9918</a></p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Contact information</strong> you provide: name, business name, email address, and phone number.</li>
    <li><strong>Business information</strong> you share during inquiries, forms, or calls.</li>
    <li><strong>Appointment and messaging data</strong> related to scheduling and follow-up.</li>
    <li><strong>Website usage data</strong> such as pages visited, referrer, device type, and browser (via standard analytics) to improve our site.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use your information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Respond to inquiries and deliver our services.</li>
    <li>Schedule, confirm, and remind you of appointments you book with us.</li>
    <li>Send SMS or email communications you have opted into.</li>
    <li>Operate and improve our website, offers, and client experience.</li>
    <li>Comply with legal obligations and enforce our agreements.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>SMS &amp; text messaging</h2>
  <div class="sms">
    <p>We send SMS only to individuals who opt in through our <strong>Growth Call booking form</strong> at{' '}
    <a href="https://rushesmedia.com/#book">https://rushesmedia.com/#book</a>. After you select a date and time, the <strong>Enter details</strong> step includes <strong>two separate checkboxes</strong> (unchecked by default):</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Customer care SMS</strong> — appointment confirmations, scheduling reminders, and follow-up related to your booking or inquiry.</li>
      <li><strong>Promotional SMS (optional)</strong> — special offers, service announcements, and marketing messages. This consent is separate from customer care and is not required to book.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Age restriction:</strong> You must be <strong>18 years of age or older</strong> to opt in to SMS. Our SMS program is not directed to anyone under 18.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Message frequency varies.</li>
      <li>Message and data rates may apply.</li>
      <li>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to opt out at any time. Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</strong> Information sharing to subcontractors in support services, such as customer service, is permitted. All other use case categories exclude text messaging originator opt-in data and consent; this information will not be shared with any third parties, excluding aggregators and providers of the Text Message services.</p>
    <p>Full SMS program terms: <a href="https://rushesmedia.com/terms/">https://rushesmedia.com/terms/</a></p>
  </div>

  <h2>How we share information</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share information with trusted service providers (such as CRM, scheduling, email, and telecommunications tools) solely to operate our business and deliver services you request. Those providers are permitted to use information only as needed to perform services on our behalf.</p>
  <p>As stated above, SMS opt-in data and consent are not sold, rented, or shared with third parties for their marketing purposes. Text messaging originator opt-in data and consent will not be shared with any third parties, excluding aggregators and providers of the Text Message services.</p>

  <h2>Cookies &amp; analytics</h2>
  <p>We may use cookies and similar technologies to understand site traffic and improve performance. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>

  <h2>Data retention &amp; security</h2>
  <p>We retain personal information only as long as needed to provide services, maintain business records, and meet legal obligations. We use reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational safeguards to protect information.</p>

  <h2>Your choices &amp; rights</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Opt out of SMS at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong>.</li>
    <li>Unsubscribe from marketing emails using the link in any email.</li>
    <li>Request access to, correction of, or deletion of your information by emailing <a href="mailto:evan@rushesmedia.com">evan@rushesmedia.com</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>Our services are directed to businesses and adults. We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The effective date at the top of this page will reflect the latest version. Continued use of our site or services after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>

  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <p><strong>Rushes Group LLC</strong> (DBA Rushes Media)<br>
  1636 Oak Avenue, Haddon Heights, NJ 08035<br>
  Email: <a href="mailto:evan@rushesmedia.com">evan@rushesmedia.com</a><br>
  Phone: <a href="tel:+16094059918">(609) 405-9918</a><br>
  Website: <a href="https://rushesmedia.com/">https://rushesmedia.com</a></p>

  <a href="https://rushesmedia.com/" class="back">← Back to rushesmedia.com</a>
</main>
</LegalLayout>
